= Katja Mast

Katja Mast from Pforzheim is the first parliamentary manager of the SPD group in the Bundestag, and the one our partners call when a coalition crisis is brewing.

- @coalition
- @toleration
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the coalition
subtitle: Calm our partners down.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if spd_in_government = 0 : We are not in government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government = 1
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent > 0; cdu_relation += 4; greens_relation += 4; fdp_relation += 4

Long evenings in the coalition committee pay off. Our partners are calmer.

@toleration
title: Defending toleration
subtitle: Explain why we keep the minority government alive.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_toleration: We are not tolerating a government. ?]
choose-if: spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the critics of toleration.

@snap_election
title: Snap election
subtitle: Ask the confidence question and go for new elections.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if chancellor_party != "SPD" : The SPD must hold the chancellery. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and chancellor_party == "SPD" and spd_in_government
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

The chancellor loses the confidence question on purpose, and the president dissolves the Bundestag. New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

